    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The Flowable sweep records two facts about Myridius: it was formerly RCG Global Services, and it is based in Princeton, New Jersey, outside the EU scope. The geography closes the row.\n\nThe rename is nonetheless worth keeping. Any earlier research, case study or directory listing for this firm sits under the previous name, so a lookup on either name alone returns a partial picture, and a deduplication pass that keys on company name will treat the two as separate firms. That is a general hazard when partner directories are mined at a single point in time: they show the current name, and the evidence trail is under the old one.\n\nBeyond the rename and the location there is nothing on the row. It was mined on 2026-08-18 and not imprint-swept, so no contact or principal was resolved.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- Myridius (US Princeton NJ) \u2014 myridius.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Formerly RCG Global Services. Non-EU \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:31:53.938414Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:31:53.938418Z"
    }
  },
